#: src/configpage.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\"GitHub\" uses GitHub's own colors. \"Match editor / system theme\" "
"recolors the same layout from the active editor theme, so the preview blends "
"with the rest of Kate."
msgstr ""
"\"GitHub\" koristi sopstvene boje GitHub-a. \"Uskladi sa temom uređivača / "
"sistema\" boji isti raspored prema aktivnoj temi uređivača, tako da se "
"pregled uklapa u ostatak programa Kate."

